roke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M20 5.5c0-.8-.7-1.5-1.5-1.5H12v16h6.5c.8 0 1.5-.7 1.5-1.5v-13z" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Blog<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-auto size-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-current border-t-transparent transition-opacity opacity-0"></span></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center rounded-lg transition outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-countdown h-8 gap-2.5 px-2.5 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-side-ink hover:bg-side-hover hover:text-white" href="/dashboards"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" class="h-4.5 w-4.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="6.5" height="6.5" rx="1.2"></rect><rect x="13.5" y="4" width="6.5" height="6.5" rx="1.2"></rect><rect x="4" y="13.5" width="6.5" height="6.5" rx="1.2"></rect><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="6.5" height="6.5" rx="1.2"></rect></svg>All dashboards<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-auto size-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-current border-t-transparent transition-opacity opacity-0"></span></a></li></ul></div></nav><form class="mt-auto border-t border-side-line px-4 py-4"><p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-white">Weekly FPL newsletter</p><div class="mt-2 flex flex-col items-stretch justify-center gap-2 "><input type="email" required="" placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email address" class="min-w-0 rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-sm border-transparent bg-white text-pitch-dark placeholder:text-pitch-dark/70 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-countdown outline-none " name="email"/><input type="text" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" aria-hidden="true" class="hidden" name="website"/><button type="submit" class="rounded-sm bg-pitch px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:bg-pitch-light disabled:opacity-60 text-side-active-ink focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-countdown outline-none">Get weekly FPL tips</button></div><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-side-muted">Free. One email a week. We&#x27;ll ask you to confirm. Unsubscribe any time.</p></form></div></aside><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-3 border-b border-border px-4 py-2"><div class="relative w-full max-w-sm"><label for="player-search" class="sr-only">Search players</label><div class="relative"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" class="pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-ink-muted"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.3"></circle><path d="m15.5 15.5 4 4" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg><input id="player-search" type="search" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="player-search-results" autoComplete="off" placeholder="Search players" class="h-9 w-full rounded-sm border border-border-strong bg-page pl-9 pr-3 text-sm text-ink outline-none placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:border-pitch-ink focus:ring-1 focus:ring-pitch-ink" value=""/></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Theme: system (click to change)" title="Theme: system" class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-border text-ink-muted transition hover:text-ink"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="14" height="10" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M7.5 17h5M10 14v3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></button><a class="text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-pitch-ink hover:text-pitch-light" href="/pro?from=header">Get Pro</a><div class="h-8 w-24 animate-pulse rounded-sm bg-surface"></div></div><aside aria-label="FPL Planner" class="planner-banner flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-pitch-ink/30 bg-pitch/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm"><a class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 text-ink hover:text-pitch-ink" href="/fpl-planner"><span class="truncate"><strong class="font-semibold">Free FPL Planner<span class="hidden sm:inline">:</span></strong><span class="hidden sm:inline"> transfers, captain and chips for the next six gameweeks, with the FPL Cat model&#x27;s points.</span><span class="hidden min-[400px]:inline sm:hidden"> · next 6 GWs</span></span><span class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-pitch-ink">Plan my team →</span></a><button type="button" aria-label="Hide the planner banner for a week" class="shrink-0 rounded-full p-1 text-ink-muted hover:text-ink">✕</button></aside><main class="flex-1"><article><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"FPL AI Assistants Compared 2026/27: 5 Tools, One Team, the Same 4 Questions","description":"We asked FPL Cat, FPL Copilot, the official FPL Companion, ChatFPL.ai and Fantasy Football Fix's ChatFPL the same four questions about one team in GW10. What they got right, what each costs, and what each is best for.","datePublished":"2026-11-05","dateModified":"2026-11-05","image":"https://fplcat.com/blog/fpl-ai-assistants-compared/opengraph-image","url":"https://fplcat.com/blog/fpl-ai-assistants-compared","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://fplcat.com/blog/fpl-ai-assistants-compared"},"isPartOf":{"@type":"Blog","name":"FPL Cat Blog","url":"https://fplcat.com/blog"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FPL Cat","url":"https://fplcat.com"},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FPL Cat","url":"https://fplcat.com"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://fplcat.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Blog","item":"https://fplcat.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"FPL AI Assistants Compared 2026/27: 5 Tools, One Team, the Same 4 Questions","item":"https://fplcat.com/blog/fpl-ai-assistants-compared"}]}</script><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-pitch-dark"><svg class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 -right-20 hidden h-96 w-96 -translate-y-1/2 text-white/10 sm:block" viewBox="0 0 200 200" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="70" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><line x1="100" y1="0" x2="100" y2="200" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></line></svg><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:py-12"><p class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-pitch-light">5 November 2026</p><h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-white sm:text-5xl">FPL AI Assistants Compared 2026/27: 5 Tools, One Team, the Same 4 Questions</h1></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12"><div class="prose dark:prose-invert mt-0 max-w-none prose-headings:text-ink prose-p:text-ink prose-strong:text-ink prose-a:text-sky-deep prose-li:text-ink prose-table:block prose-table:overflow-x-auto"><div><p>Several FPL tools now let you ask an AI about your own team: who to captain, what to transfer, when to play a chip. They read your squad in different ways, some answer in predicted points and some don't, and their free allowances range from a few messages to a few hundred.</p>
<p>To compare them, we gave five of them the same team in the same gameweek and asked the same four questions. Here is what mattered, what each one costs, and what each one is good for.</p>
<h2>Which FPL AI assistant is best for what</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong><a href="/fpl-planner">FPL Cat</a>: best for asking about your squad inside a free multi-week planner.</strong> Its captain and transfer answers came in the FPL Cat model's projected points, and it knew the Wildcard had been played. Up to about 150 messages a month free (five a day) with a sign-in. Try it free: <a href="https://fplcat.com/fpl-planner">https://fplcat.com/fpl-planner</a></li>
<li><strong><a href="https://www.chatfpl.ai/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">ChatFPL.ai</a>: best for trying an FPL chatbot without a card.</strong> 20 free messages, then plans priced by the number of messages, and text answers that came back in a few seconds.</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://www.fantasyfootballfix.com/chat/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Fantasy Football Fix's ChatFPL</a>: best for a large free question allowance inside a full FPL toolkit.</strong> ChatFPL Lite gives a free account about 250 questions for life; transfer advice needs the paid Pro model.</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://fplcopilot.com/copilot" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">FPL Copilot</a>: best for expected points and cards alongside the advice.</strong> Its captain, transfer and Isak answers each came with expected points, and it was the only assistant to name the one-transfer way to afford Isak. Chat is part of its Pro plan, with a 30-day trial.</li>
<li><strong><a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Official FPL Companion</a>: best for asking about your team with no setup.</strong> It's on the FPL website and reads your squad, bank and chips from your FPL login.</li>
</ul>
<h2>How we tested</h2>
<p>One team, one gameweek, four questions: who should I captain this week, what's one transfer from my weakest spot, should I Wildcard now or later, and can I buy Isak with my budget. The team had one free transfer and £0.5m in the bank, Haaland as captain, an injured João Pedro on the bench, and its Wildcard already played in Gameweek 3, so the Wildcard question tested whether an assistant reads chips from the team. Isak cost £9.2m: with three forwards per squad, only selling Haaland funded him in one transfer.</p>
<p>Every tool was tested on 4 November 2026, before the Gameweek 10 deadline. FPL Copilot's chat was used on its 30-day trial; Fantasy Football Fix's paid ChatFPL Pro was not tested. Each answer was seen once: assistants can answer differently another time, so read this as a snapshot.</p>
