{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4096]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4096]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4096]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4112],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/159ec5dc56b8268c.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"className\":\"__variable_ff4230 __variable_619e40 h-full antialiased\",\"suppressHydrationWarning\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"head\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"(function(){try{var c=localStorage.getItem(\\\"fplcat-theme\\\");var t=c===\\\"light\\\"||c===\\\"dark\\\"?c:(window.matchMedia(\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\\\").matches?\\\"light\\\":\\\"dark\\\");document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t;}catch(e){}})();\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-full font-sans\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://fplcat.com/#organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"FPL Cat\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://fplcat.com\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"https://fplcat.com/logo.jpg\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"FPL Cat (fplcat.com) is a Fantasy Premier League (FPL) website with an AI assistant that knows your squad. Free tools: an FPL planner with the FPL Cat model's projected points, a gameweek review against your mini-league, live bonus points and DEFCON, injury news, price changes, fixture difficulty and stats. It also works inside ChatGPT and Claude. An independent fan project, not affiliated with the Premier League or Fantasy Premier League.\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"hello@fplcat.com\\\",\\\"sameAs\\\":[\\\"https://x.com/kotzwysp\\\",\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@FPLCats\\\"]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebSite\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://fplcat.com/#website\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"FPL Cat\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://fplcat.com\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"FPL Cat (fplcat.com) is a Fantasy Premier League (FPL) website with an AI assistant that knows your squad. Free tools: an FPL planner with the FPL Cat model's projected points, a gameweek review against your mini-league, live bonus points and DEFCON, injury news, price changes, fixture difficulty and stats. It also works inside ChatGPT and Claude. An independent fan project, not affiliated with the Premier League or Fantasy Premier League.\\\",\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://fplcat.com/#organization\\\"}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"old\":[105666,155405,200641,220583,465694,477547,489580,490161,499726,596047],\"none\":[176412,213292,241117,242893,465525,494950,499716,500957,505079,519440,536108,538638,546600,549653,551262,554054,567119,569577,571380,576620,590014,590039,595480,601767,616069,629397,645618,655585,661016,661313,671875,672492,684268],\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-h-full flex-col md:flex-row\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"liveBonusEnabled\":true,\"deadlines\":[{\"event\":11,\"deadline\":\"2026-11-21T11:00:00Z\"},{\"event\":12,\"deadline\":\"2026-11-27T18:30:00Z\"},{\"event\":13,\"deadline\":\"2026-12-01T18:30:00Z\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-end gap-3 border-b border-border px-4 py-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"billingEnabled\":true}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[[\"$\",\"title\",null,{\"children\":\"404: This page could not be found.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,\\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\",\\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\"\",\"height\":\"100vh\",\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"flexDirection\":\"column\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"style\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"body{color:#000;background:#fff;margin:0}.next-error-h1{border-right:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.3)}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#fff;background:#000}.next-error-h1{border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)}}\"}}],\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\"]}]}]],[]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]}],\"$Le\"]}]]}],\"$Lf\"]}]}]}],\"$L10\",\"$L11\"]}]]}]]}],{\"children\":[\"$L12\",{\"children\":[\"$L13\",{\"children\":[\"$L14\",{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$15\"]},null,false,\"$15\"]},null,false,null],\"$L16\",false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$17\",[]],\"S\":false,\"h\":null,\"r\":\"$undefined\",\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"a\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\",\"b\":\"RJJFewIILU0FLwjffR5-G\"}\n18:I[8500,[\"8500\",\"static/chunks/8500-b4285e7e4d843081.js\",\"7962\",\"static/chunks/7962-e083cc72040ccc82.js\",\"4480\",\"static/chunks/4480-f3ab0b91ef5b4a29.js\",\"525\",\"static/chunks/525-b2a6203cf76351db.js\",\"5953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-96e202a5a157a69c.js\"],\"\"]\n19:I[3149,[\"8500\",\"static/chunks/8500-b4285e7e4d843081.js\",\"7962\",\"static/chunks/7962-e083cc72040ccc82.js\",\"600\",\"static/chunks/600-680351602939b51d.js\",\"8588\",\"static/chunks/8588-510841f454da056d.js\",\"274\",\"static/chunks/274-f7f